  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet goes in through the side of your neck, leaving an impressive hole as it starts tumbling while digging its way through your sternocleidomastoid muscle, missing your carotid artery by a hair. It finally lodges, nestled up against your cervical spine, punching it hard enough to temporarily stun your spinal cord.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You are temporarily paralyzed from the neck down, effectively gaining the @Condition[Unconscious] Condition except you are awake and aware the whole time. Roll at the beginning of each of your subsequent turns, needing to pass a <strong>Difficult (-10) Toughness</strong> Test to recover, removing the Condition. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Challenging)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
